{"title": "Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'", "pageid": 12105, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Perform_'The_Queen's_High_Seas'", "categories": ["Class actions", "Divinity references", "Performable music"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp/300px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp, /w/images/e/ed/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp/300px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'</b> is a free action that allows the user to play the song 'The Queen's High Seas' using their equipped <a href=\"/wiki/Instrument\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Instrument\">Instrument</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nPlay a jaunty sea shanty to rouse and excite those around you.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Drum</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Drum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Drum\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Flute</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Flute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Flute\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Lute</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Lute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Lute\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Lyre</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Lyre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Violin</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Violin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Violin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Whistle</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Whistle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_DOS2_3_Whistle\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=DontAbortPerforming_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DontAbortPerforming (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">DontAbortPerforming</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ImmediateCast_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ImmediateCast (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">ImmediateCast</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Performing_.27The_Queen.27s_High_Seas.27\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Performing_'The_Queen's_High_Seas'\"> Condition: Performing 'The Queen's High Seas' </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_(Condition)\" title=\"Performing 'The Queen's High Seas' (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performing 'The Queen's High Seas'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performing_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_(Condition)\" title=\"Performing 'The Queen's High Seas' (Condition)\">Performing 'The Queen's High Seas'</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Playing a tune. Perform the same song nearby to join in.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Poor_Performance\"> Condition: Poor Performance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poor Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\">Poor Performance</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Maybe you'd better stop, before anyone starts throwing rocks.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Included in the <a href=\"/wiki/Digital_Deluxe_Upgrade\" title=\"Digital Deluxe Upgrade\">Digital Deluxe Edition</a> DLC</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If multiple characters use the Perform action, they sync up and play together. Also nearby bards, such as in the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a>, can join the performance.\n<ul><li>If multiple characters perform the same song, the individual instruments can be heard together as the song is played (e.g., <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\">lute</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\">violin</a>).</li>\n<li>Multiple instruments are more easily heard if ambient volume in the game's audio settings is moved to or near zero.\n<ul><li>A harmonious example of multiple instruments can occur after Ketheric Thorm's defeat, when a player character on the violin joins Alfira on her lute to perform for the tiefling children.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Nearby NPCs gather to hear the performance and focus their attention on the performer(s). This can create an opportunity for pickpocketing and thievery. Many patrolling NPCs cannot be distracted this way.</li>\n<li>If the performer has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency#Instrument_proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">musical instrument proficiency</a>, they make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/38px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/50px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> check. If successful, the gathered audience tips the performer with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/30px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/40px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toss a Coin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\">Toss a Coin</a> when the performance ends. However, a successful performance does not necessarily result in every attendee tipping the performer(s).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> of the performance check scales with the size of the audience:\n<ul><li>1 audience member: DC 10</li>\n<li>2-3 audience members: DC 12</li>\n<li>4-5 audience members: DC 15</li>\n<li>6-7 audience members: DC 18</li>\n<li>8+ audience members: DC 20</li></ul></li>\n<li>Any character can use the Perform action with an instrument equipped. However, a character without instrument proficiency makes a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poor Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\">Poor Performance</a> when doing so. This provokes annoyed reactions from the audience who will leave immediately.</li>\n<li>Perform is a free action, and can be used during battle. The performance ends if the performing character is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>This song is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_references\" title=\"Cultural references\">reference</a> to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divinity_(series)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Divinity series\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divinity_(series)\">Divinity series</a></span>, a franchise by <a href=\"/wiki/Larian_Studios\" title=\"Larian Studios\">Larian Studios</a>.\n<ul><li>It is an arrangement of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fvyx7vZy13E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"The Queen's High Seas\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fvyx7vZy13E\">The Queen's High Seas</a></span> from Divinity: Original Sin 2 by Borislav Slavov; also titled 'Beast's Theme'.</li>\n<li>The central motif is derived from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a_PZ2x2_vPI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Drunk with Dwarven Mirth\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a_PZ2x2_vPI\">Drunk with Dwarven Mirth</a></span> from Divine Divinity by Kirill Pokrovsky, also present in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Ij0eebp1zw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Divinity: Original Sin\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Ij0eebp1zw\">Divinity: Original Sin</a></span>, albeit not in the OST.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In-Game_Performance\">In-Game Performance</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"embedvideo\" data-service=\"youtube\" data-mw-iframeconfig=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VYzzppkNZ9E?autoplay=1&amp;start=211&quot;}\" style=\"width:640px\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper\" style=\"height:360px\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-consent\" data-show-privacy-notice=\"1\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-load